      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "To generate the SBM graph, I need to define the community sizes and the probability matrix, then use `nx.stochastic_block_model` and construct the ground-truth communities.\n",
        "\n"
      ],
      "id": "04bc6e4a"
