        "## Evaluate Detected Communities with NMI/ARI\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Calculate Normalized Mutual Information (NMI) and Adjusted Rand Index (ARI) to compare the detected communities against the SBM's ground-truth communities.\n"
