      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "Now that the utility function `communities_to_labels` is defined, I will convert the ground truth and detected communities into node label lists. Then, I will calculate and print the NMI and ARI scores for both Label Propagation and Louvain algorithms against the ground truth.\n",
        "\n"
      ],
